      <title>Xenocara: X.Org modular for OpenBSD</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>X.org</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Xenocara: adapting X.Org modular to OpenBSD&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After a few short reminders on OpenBSD, this talk will show how the modular X.Org build system affected the integration of X in OpenBSD and the solutions that have been implemented. I&amp;#39;ll will also present some ideas about general portability and interoperability concerns in the context of non Linux platforms for future X developments.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2191">Matthieu Herrb</person>
      </persons>
